<title>USA: Intelligent Electronics Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Intelligent Electronics Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>EXTON, Pa. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>INTELLIGENT ELECTRONICS INC and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			 (in thousands, except per-share data)</p>
