<p>NOTE: loss for the third quarter included tax adjusted charges of $88.6 million. Management actions have included cutting costs, reassessing under-performing assets, reducing excess headcount and developing the architecture for strategic success. The actions have resulted in the following charges during the third quarter: $55.5 million in goodwill associated with acquisitions of Entre Computer Centers and Connecting Point of America; $26.4 million relating to the direct business as a result of consolidating under-performing branches and other facilities;  $11.1 million for the write-down of certain software technology to estimated recoverable amounts and various receivable reserves and other miscellaneous accruals.</p>
